file tools/p/parity_ch02.rish swept, 147 characters, re-derived from its committed bytes
file construction/ITINERARY.md elder account shelved whole; the new block names the wire, the minus row, and the tree-wide sweep as Keaton's word
scope one keystone -- the Rish spoken meter's converter and its missing table row, plus a two-file sweep that pays a share and proves the tool on real bytes
status GREEN -- cold roster 245 run, 242 green, 0 red, 3 gated, tree_moved=no; spoken_ascii witness GREEN at 31 affirmative and 5 refusals; both swept files re-derived byte-identical from HEAD; converter card A 91
